<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0527_T10R0601_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: *cape flutters, no wind*\nI been waitin’ on you.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI KNEW you, with your skills,\nwould end up right here.\rNo need for words now.\n...But I’ma say some anyway.\rWe gon’ scrap to see who the\nhardest of the two of us.\rAs the strongest Hustler and the\nBig League KINGPIN...\rI, Lance the dragon master, cape\nmodel, accept your challenge!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0527_T10R0601_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lance: *cape flutters, no wind*\nI been waitin’ on you.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI KNEW you, with your skills,\nwould end up right here.\rNo need for words now.\n...But I’ma say some anyway.\rWe gon’ scrap to see who the\nhardest of the two of us.\rAs the strongest Hustler and the\nBig League KINGPIN...\rI, Lance the dragon master, cape\nmodel, accept your challenge!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0527_T10R0601_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Whew. *cape stops flutterin’*\rYou got REAL strong, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nStronger than the CAPE.\rYour homies ride for you ’cause you\nsolid and you REAL. That’s somethin’\fa\fcape can’t buy. I tried.\rAs a Hustler, you gon’ keep gettin’\nstronger. I’ma go cry in my cape.\r</language>
	</row>
