		<language name="English">...Whew. *cape stops flutterin’*\rYou got REAL strong, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nStronger than the CAPE.\rYour homies ride for you ’cause you\nsolid and you REAL. That’s somethin’\fa\fcape can’t buy. I tried.\rAs a Hustler, you gon’ keep gettin’\nstronger. I’ma go cry in my cape.\r</language>
