		<language name="English">Professor Oak: Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! Long\ntime no see. You lookin’ real\fimpressive. *sniff*\rYou ran the WHOLE League! That’s\nINSANE! I’m hyperventilatin’!\rYour dedication, trust, and love for\nyour homies made it happen.\rYour homies was OUTSTANDIN’ too.\nThey believed in you, so they kept\fgoin’.\rCongrats, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}! *sniff* I’m\ncryin’.\r</language>
